<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-U.S. Long Distance started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-U.S. Long Distance started.</headline>
<text>
<p>--Rauscher Pierce Refsnes analyst Harry Blount said he started coverage of U.S. Long Distance Corp with a buy-market outperformer rating.</p>
<p>--Shares in the long distance company were off 5/16 to 8-5/16.</p>
<p>--Blount said the company's spin-off of Billing Information Concepts freed it to accelerate revenue growth and improve profitability.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787))</p>
